    "title": "‘Mr Lucky’ on a Mission to Ensure His Winning Streak Is No Fluke",
    "excerpt": "Ranked #22 in Business on the 2016 GG2 Power 101 list of Britain's most influential Asians.",
    "date": "2016",
    "listImg": "/magazines/images/mag_power101_2016.jpg",
    "listAlt": "‘Mr Lucky’ on a Mission to Ensure His Winning Streak Is No Fluke",
    "eyebrow": "GG2 Power 101",
